  "description": "One indispensable secretary, two irresistible heirs. I-Yeon Chu, the most sought-after personal assistant in Jaekyung Group, has the two would-be heirs vying for more than just future ownership of the company. And while I-Yeon is balancing the precarious love triangle, she’s also digging into the mysterious death of her father who used to be chauffeur to the former Jaekyung Group chairman. Will I-Yeon find both truth and true love? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON, edited)",
